e he thinks it'll  transform him into a dragon  which leaves the realm in a bit of a  succession pickle  who should be the next king daeron and  aerion both had kids but no one wants  them on the throne  so they offer maester aim on the throne  but he refuses  so the next king of westeros is egg he  becomes king  aegon targaryen v and king egg  chooses dunk to lead his kingsguard so  dunk from flea bottom  rises to the highest position for a  night in westeros  king egg's rule was difficult with  rebellious lords and  rebellious children and later in life he  became convinced that the solution to  all his problems was  dragons he was obsessed with trying to  hatch some dragon eggs experimenting  with  sorcery wildfire and ancient lore  and this dream of dragons ended in  tragedy  a mysterious fire at summerhall killed  king egg  and most of his family and dunk  one of the only survivors was egg's  granddaughter raela  and it's hinted that she was saved from  the fire by dunk before he died  then while summerhall burned behind her  raela gave  birth to rhaegar targaryen the brother  of viserys and daenerys and the father  of jon snow so maybe dunk was  right there was a day when the realm  needed him  if he hadn't saved raela rhaegar and  daenerys and jon snow would have never  been born  the whole series wouldn't have happened  and all of this began  with dunk seeing the comet that inspired  his heraldry  a comet or bleeding star is part of the  prophecy of azor ahai  the hero that'll save the world rhaegar  believed that his son would be this hero  when he saw a falling star  so dunk is deeply connected to the  prophetic destiny of westeros  but will this destiny save westeros or  lead to more  fire and tragedy dunk says we never know  what the morrow will bring all he can do  is try his best to be a true knight  the hedge knight asks what does it mean  to be  a true knight it's clearly not about  being a  highborn noble warrior with sword and  armor cause  arion's a piece of [ __ ] and it's not  about being skilled or smart  cause dunk isn't it was dunk's foolish  romantic impulse that led him to be a  hero in the first place  it's not about a special ceremony and  it's not about telling the truth  dunk and egg both lie to get to the  tourney  a big part of what makes dunk a hero is  his  humility noble lords and knights have  too much to lose to want to fight for  justice  but dunk has nothing to lose but his  honor and that's why he risks everything  to protect  others as a low-born commoner he's more  sympathetic to other common people  and dunk's humble origins are what allow  him to beat arion  using dirty flea bottom fighting tricks  to bait the fancy prince  humility helps make dunk a true knight  so at the end of the story micah offers  for dunk and egg to join his  knights at his castle but instead dunk  takes egg on the road to live  as a hedge knight because that humility  will help egg grow  into a better man and a better king  the story criticizes a corrupt system of  nobility  and celebrates a more humble ideal of  heroism where  anyone with courage and strength and  compassion  can be a true knight and 90 years later  brienne's story explores the same ideas  like dunk she's technically not a knight  she's not particularly smart  or special but she's strong and brave  and selfless and determined to do what's  right  which makes her more of a true knight  than almost any actual knight  in book four brienne describes an old  shield from her father's armory which  looks exactly like  dunk's shield with the tree and star so  for years fans have speculated that  brienne  and dunk might be related and at a  convention author george martin  confirmed that dunk  is brienne's ancestor possibly her  great-grandpa  so dunk's legacy as a humble true knight  continues in brienne at the end of the  hedge night  dunk and egg head off for more  adventures there are two more duncan egg  stories after the hedge night  and you can get all of them on audiobook  for free right now by signing up for a  trial with audible  a knight of the seven kingdoms collects  all three duncan egg stories  read on audiobook by harry lloyd the  actor who played viserys on game of  thrones  or you could get june or his dark  materials  audible members get an audio book each  month plus audible originals and if you  cancel you keep the audio books  you can listen while you ride with your  squier or while you sleep beneath the  stars  sign up at audible.com asx  comment below if you want more videos  about the next two dunkin egg stories  thanks to the artists and check out the  articles linked below for more on the  hedge night  thanks for watching and thanks to the  patrons including amanda lim  jack stasco jogging c137 prince  jaehaerys flinted steel  marianne fletcher janine clark and  sneaky penguin  cheers  i offer you a nice egg in this trying  time

